### Регистрация
POST http://localhost:5141/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User",
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Неверный пароль
POST http://localhost:5141/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Добавить заявку 
POST http://localhost:5141/api/JobApplications
Authorization: Bearer <токен>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "companyName": "Google",
    "position": "Developer",
    "status": "Pending",
    "appliedDate": "2026-09-28T00:00:00",
    "tags": [".NET", "Azure"]
}